msgid "[[\"FluxWP's installation and update plugin. Installation wizard at first startup (introduction, plugin selection, appearance, installation); Brings FluxWP themes and plugins from the update server (default updater.fluxwp.com) to WordPress' update screen; The preset engine (preset.json) sets up the site in one step, replaces it with approved patches, and rolls it back.\", 'tr']]"
msgstr "[[\"FluxWP 的安装和更新插件。第一次启动时的安装向导(介绍、插件选择、外观、安装);将 FluxWP 主题和插件从更新服务器(默认 updater.fluxwp.com)带到 WordPress 的更新屏幕;预设引擎(preset.json)一步设置站点,用批准的补丁替换它,然后回滚。\", 'tr']]"

